&lt;p&gt;In my first year out in the countryside, at Zhudong Veterans Hospital (now Taipei Veterans General Hospital, Hsinchu Branch), something truly terrifying happened.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="a-cobra-came-to-my-house-xd"&gt;&lt;code&gt;A cobra came to my house XD&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So the boss at home (my wife) cut a video to commemorate it😅😅😅&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the end, our EMT brothers caught it and sent it off to live somewhere else🥰&lt;/p&gt;
